# ASMA Figma Design System

When the task involves a Figma URL, Design System components, design-to-code, or Code Connect:

1. Read `.agents/skills/asma-figma-design-system/SKILL.md` and its `component-map.md` resource.
2. Design System fileKey is always `wXrXt5uKNNzV2DnQCgyYZH`. Prefer published library **Design System**.
3. Implement with `asma-ui-core` / `asma-ui-icons` / `asma-ui-table` / `asma-ui-datetime` / `asma-ui-richeditor` / `asma-ui-notistack` — see `_docs/ASMA_UI_COMPONENTS.md`.
4. Never leave Figma MCP React+Tailwind stubs in the final code. Example: Figma `Button` → `StyledButton` from `asma-ui-core`.
5. If Code Connect tools work, prefer published mappings. If they error on seat/plan, use the local component map — do not invent new primitives.
6. New Code Connect files belong in the owning package (`shared/asma-ui-core/src/figma/*.figma.tsx`), CLI-first.
